# Keep the build context to sources and manifests. Anything built, installed or
# stateful is either rebuilt inside the image or must never enter it.
#
# `dist/` in particular: a stale local build must not be able to end up in the
# image instead of the one the Dockerfile makes.

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage

# Runtime state (decision 6). A developer's local database is not image content.
data
**/data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

.git
.github
.claude
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode

# Documents, not build inputs.
*.md
LICENSE
